The TS-271D NAS is suitable for smaller home networks for families and small businesses in need of backup storage at more affordable rack-mount prices. It features 2.5GbE and PCIe 2.0x Gen1 connectivity, as well as a 2.5GbE interface that provides 4k input/output for high-definition video recording at 10 Mbps. The TS-271D is equipped with Intel’s Celeron® Quad Core M. 2.0 GHz Processor, supporting RAID 0+0/1 to maximize storage capacity. You can store up to 32GB of data for your favorite files, including photos, music, and videos, as well as install QNAP storage software to streamline your files and keep your network organized.
